[ ] Retest (3rd+ touch)
      Price retested the level xyz again..

[ ] Price-action follow-through — ONLY for the major EMA clusters
    (1E50/100/200, 5E50/100/200, 30E50/100/200, 2E50/100/200, DE50/100/200,
    WE50/100/200, ME50/100/200). Armed ONLY when the level is announced as
    touched/retested; then an AGGRESSIVE candle (body >= 1.5x the average
    body of the previous 5 bars) closing beyond the level, next bar onward
    (15-bar validity, one fire per episode):
      support hold + aggressive bull candle closing above ->
          Price rises above 1E200
      resistance hold + aggressive bear candle closing below ->
          Price falls below 1E200
      // sequence: retest -> takes support/faces resistance -> rises above /
      // falls below

